WEBVTT

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.790
- [honking loudly]
- Oh!

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:12.030
Oh... Oh! Oh... [mooing]

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:15.910
[gas sloshing, backfiring]

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.870
[laughing loudly]

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.070
I swear, tractors is so dumb!

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:25.950
I tell you what, buddy,
it don't get much better than this.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.630
Yep, you're livin' the dream, Mater boy.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.230
- [honking]
- Oh!

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:37.910
Oh! Oh... [mooing]

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.870
[gas sloshing, backfiring]

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:44.910
[laughing] I don't care who you are,
that's funny right there.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:46.750
Oh, your turn, bud.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:49.230
Mater, I can't.
I don't even have a horn.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:51.510
- Baby.
- I'm not a baby.

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:52.550
[clucking]

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:56.070
Fine. Stop! Stop, OK?
All right. I'll do something.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:06.030
[snoring]

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:16.550
- [revving engine]
- Oh!

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:20.990
[all exclaiming and mooing]

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:30.910
[all gurgling]

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:36.030
[all backfiring]

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:43.910
[angry mooing]

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:46.750
[mooing]

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.470
That's Frank.

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:53.550
- [bellowing angrily]
- [shouting]

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:58.310
- [mooing]
- [engine revving]

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:07.950
[Mater laughing]

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:10.710
Run!

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:12.790
- Here he comes, look out!
- [bellowing]

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:15.390
[laughing] Whoa!

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:17.990
[screaming]

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.350
Run! He's gonna get ya!

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:30.750
[Mater laughing]

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:41.830
Oh! Customers!

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.510
Oh!

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.950
Ah, no, no, no.

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.750
Oof! Oh!

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:54.190
[Mater] Tomorrow night we can
go look for the ghostlight!

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:57.750
- I can't wait, Mater.
- Oh, yeah, I'm tellin' ya!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:02.110
Oh, boy,
you gotta admit that was fun!

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:04.110
Oh, yeah... yeah.

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:07.270
Well, we better get you
back to the impound lot.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:10.550
You know, actually,
Sally's gonna let me stay at the motel.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:11.630
Oh...

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:16.950
- Gettin' cozy at the Cone, is we?
- Oh, come... No. No, are you kidding?

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:21.310
Besides, she can't stand me.
And I don't like her, to be honest.

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:25.270
Yeah, you probably right.
Hey, look, there's Miss Sally!

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.070
- Where, where?
- [laughing]

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:30.710
- You're in love with Miss Sally.
- No, I'm not.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.990
- [Mater] Yes, you do.
- [Lightning] No way.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.230
- Way.
- Come on, look...

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.750
- You're in love with Miss Sally!
- Real mature.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:38.430
- You're in love!
- Real grown up.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.390
- You love her. You love her.
- Wait...

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:42.470
You love her!
You love her. You love her.

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.070
All right. OK. Mater, enough!

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:46.150
- Will you stop that?
- Stop what?

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:49.550
Driving backwards. It's creeping me out.
You're gonna wreck.

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:54.510
Wreck? Shoot!
I'm the world's best backwards driver!

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:57.710
You just watch this right here,
lover boy. Wee-hee!

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.430
[Lightning] What are you doing?
Watch out! Look out!

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:01.910
Mater? Mater!

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:05.590
- Mater!
- [laughing]

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.150
Hey, take it easy, Mater!

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.630
[screaming happily]

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.950
Oof!

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:28.430
[blubbering] Yee-hee!

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.750
[chuckling] He's nuts.

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:34.310
No need to watch where I'm goin'.

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:38.790
Just need to know where I've been.

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:41.990
Whoa, that was incredible!
How'd you do that?

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:46.110
Rearview mirrors. We'll get you some,
and I'll teach you if you want.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:49.390
[chuckling] Yeah,
maybe I'll use it in my big race.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:52.990
What's so important
about this race of yours, anyway?

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:58.230
It's not just a race.
We're talking about the Piston Cup!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.670
I've been dreaming about it
my whole life!

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:03.750
I'll be the first rookie in history
ever to win it.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:07.350
And when I do,
we're talkin' big new sponsor,

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:09.110
with private helicopters.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:12.470
No more medicated bumper ointment.
No more rusty old cars.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.670
What's wrong with rusty old cars?

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:20.070
Well, I don't mean you, Mater.
I mean other old cars. You know?

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:23.350
- Not like you. I like you.
- It's OK, buddy.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:28.350
Hey, you think maybe one day I can
get a ride in one of them helicopters?

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:33.030
I mean, I've always wanted to ride
in one of them fancy helicopters.

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:35.910
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, sure, sure.
- You mean it?

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:37.750
Oh, yeah. Anything you say.

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:41.790
I knew it. I knowed
I made a good choice!

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.710
In what?

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:46.550
My best friend.

